Third-party code
----------------

The provider layer in bin/omani-provider is derived from ani-cli:

    https://github.com/pystardust/ani-cli
    Copyright (C) pystardust and ani-cli contributors
    GPL-3.0-or-later

Specifically, the request handling, the search and episode-list scraping, the
m3u8 resolution and the quality selection follow ani-cli's implementation.

When the site replaced its player, the way a stream is resolved was adapted
from the same project's fallback branch: reading the player id from the embed
page, asking its sources endpoint for the episode, and opening the sealed
playlist with a fixed key. Omani is therefore a derivative work and carries the
same license.
